    "Image": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disk image"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In „Programme“ funktionieren Autostart, Siri-Befehle und Updates zuverlässig. Hoku startet danach einmal neu.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In “Applications”, launch at login, Siri commands, and updates work reliably. Hoku then restarts once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In „Programme“ verschieben": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move to “Applications”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inhalt": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Contains"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ist dein Mac im selben Netzwerk wie die Bridge, und leuchten ihre Lämpchen?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Is your Mac on the same network as the bridge, and are its lights on?"
